    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "早上的这里跟昨天下午完全不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "人少了很多，也安静多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "连水面看起来都更平静。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我最喜欢旅行里的早晨。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "为什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "因为不用赶时间，也还没有很多游客。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前旅行总想睡晚一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "偶尔早起一次也不错。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且今天我们不用特别去什么地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，走到哪儿算哪儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这句话听起来很轻松。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "本来周末旅行就是为了放松。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我发现慢一点儿以后，看到的东西反而更多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "因为你没有一直看下一站。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天我们走到那座桥就回来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "好，然后回去吃早饭。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个早晨已经很值得了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc037_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就慢慢走，不着急。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
